<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2630227870"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1770240363"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Little Dancer"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="楠木ともり"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Little Dancer"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:22.961"><div begin="00:16.940" end="03:15.928"><p begin="00:16.940" end="00:19.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">空虚なこの部屋を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这尽显空虚的房间</span></p><p begin="00:20.192" end="00:23.341" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">掻き乱す重低音<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遭到重低音干扰</span></p><p begin="00:23.760" end="00:26.075" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">壊れたヘッドホンで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">干脆戴上坏掉的耳机</span></p><p begin="00:26.477" end="00:29.794" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">悪魔と踊れLittle Dancer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与恶魔共舞 小小的舞者</span></p><p begin="00:29.794" end="00:35.527" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">「ここだよ」って叫んでみる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竭力地发出呐喊“我在这里”</span></p><p begin="00:36.077" end="00:39.327" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">目一杯 手を伸ばして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽全力朝前方伸出手</span></p><p begin="00:39.693" end="00:42.642" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">この世界に触れた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此碰触这个世界</span></p><p begin="00:43.414" end="00:49.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Dramaticな現実が欲しくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望戏剧性的现实可以降临</span></p><p begin="00:48.287" end="00:50.258" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">~To the next stage~<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈步走向下个阶段</span></p><p begin="00:49.992" end="00:55.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">私だけのビート刻むよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">铭刻下独属于我的节拍</span></p><p begin="00:54.958" end="00:56.656" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">~It's show time~<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">演出时间开始</span></p><p begin="00:56.656" end="00:59.407" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">誰も追いつけないStep<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈出无人能及的步伐吧</span></p><p begin="00:59.990" end="01:02.688" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">光さえ味方にして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连光芒也与我为伍</span></p><p begin="01:02.933" end="01:06.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">キミが気づいてくれるまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至你对此有所意识为止</span></p><p begin="01:07.186" end="01:11.385" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">今宵も踊り続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今晚也将继续起舞</span></p><p begin="01:12.377" end="01:14.727" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">大事にしまってた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将那个珍藏已久的</span></p><p begin="01:15.525" end="01:18.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">パンドラを つついてみる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">潘多拉魔盒打开一条缝</span></p><p begin="01:18.879" end="01:21.362" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">解き放つ衝動<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让冲动释放而出</span></p><p begin="01:21.816" end="01:25.161" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">天使と鳴らせDiscord<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与天使奏响不和谐音吧</span></p><p begin="01:25.161" end="01:30.878" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">「まだだよ」って聴こえてくる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“还不可以”的告诫传入耳畔</span></p><p begin="01:31.476" end="01:34.774" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">境界線飛び越えたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一旦飞越那条界限后</span></p><p begin="01:34.863" end="01:38.079" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">本当の私が見えた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就能看到真正的我</span></p><p begin="01:38.765" end="01:44.498" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Dramaticな現実が欲しくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望戏剧性的现实可以降临</span></p><p begin="01:43.632" end="01:45.668" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">~To the next stage~<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈步走向下个阶段</span></p><p begin="01:45.302" end="01:51.002" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">私だけのビート刻むよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">铭刻下独属于我的节拍</span></p><p begin="01:50.435" end="01:52.065" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">~It's show time~<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">演出时间开始</span></p><p begin="01:52.065" end="01:54.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">誰も追いつけないStep<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈出无人能及的步伐吧</span></p><p begin="01:55.334" end="01:58.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">光さえ味方にして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连光芒也与我为伍</span></p><p begin="01:58.283" end="02:02.283" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">キミが気づいてくれるまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至你对此有所意识为止</span></p><p begin="02:02.485" end="02:06.851" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">今宵も踊り続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今晚也将继续起舞</span></p><p begin="02:13.032" end="02:14.535" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">全身駆け抜けるSignal<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">信号正涌动于全身上下</span></p><p begin="02:14.652" end="02:16.236" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">極超音速的デフラグ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以极超音速碎片整理</span></p><p begin="02:16.370" end="02:17.554" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">生まれ変わる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">历经重生</span></p><p begin="02:17.668" end="02:19.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">エレクトリックな開眼<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在电流的刺激下顿悟</span></p><p begin="02:19.660" end="02:20.327" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">I know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实我们都很清楚</span></p><p begin="02:20.329" end="02:20.996" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">You know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何不凭本能</span></p><p begin="02:20.996" end="02:21.564" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">本能<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">何不</span></p><p begin="02:21.564" end="02:22.186" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Why not<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此超越心跳的节奏</span></p><p begin="02:22.196" end="02:24.284" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Oh 超えてゆけるBPM</p><p begin="02:24.334" end="02:26.468" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">掴めそうなソニック<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎可以感受到共振</span></p><p begin="02:27.402" end="02:33.134" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">小さくても 確かな心音<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心跳微弱可确实能感受</span></p><p begin="02:33.983" end="02:37.351" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">此処にいる意味が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">存在于此的意义</span></p><p begin="02:37.351" end="02:40.034" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">聴こえてくるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已传入我的耳畔</span></p><p begin="02:40.681" end="02:43.528" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">誰も追いつけないStep<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈出无人能及的步伐吧</span></p><p begin="02:44.047" end="02:46.681" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">光さえ味方にして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连光芒也与我为伍</span></p><p begin="02:46.998" end="02:50.782" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">キミが気づいてくれるまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至你对此有所意识为止</span></p><p begin="02:51.249" end="02:55.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">今宵も踊り続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今晚也将继续起舞</span></p><p begin="02:56.202" end="02:59.968" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Diving into the midnight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深潜至午夜当中</span></p><p begin="03:00.785" end="03:03.746" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">何度転んでもStand up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论跌倒多少次仍要重新站起</span></p><p begin="03:04.251" end="03:07.017" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">過去も未来も抱きしめて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将过去与未来一并拥入怀中吧</span></p><p begin="03:07.148" end="03:11.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">月の鼓動に合わせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以皎月的悸动为节拍</span></p><p begin="03:11.316" end="03:15.928" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">今宵も踊り続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今晚也将继续起舞</span></p></div></body></tt>